ig) than Hilla.","a":["bigger"]},{"k":"gap","q":"It is the ___ (important) day of my life.","a":["most important"]},{"k":"mc","q":"You ___ eat healthy food.","o":["should","shouldn't"],"a":0}],"kt":[],"wf":[],"passages":[{"title":"My New Neighbour","text":"Hello! My name is Huda. I am twelve years old and I live in Basra with my parents and my little brother. Last week, a new family moved into the house next to ours. They have a daughter called Lina. She is my age and she likes books and football, like me. Every afternoon, we play in the garden after school. On Fridays, my mother makes tea and cake, and Lina's family visits us. I am very happy because now I have a new friend.","qs":[{"q":"Huda lives in Basra.","k":"tf","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"Lina is older than Huda.","k":"tf","o":["True","False"],"a":1},{"q":"When does Lina's family visit Huda's family?","k":"mcq","o":["On Mondays","On Fridays","Every afternoon"],"a":1}]},{"title":"A Busy Morning","text":"Omar is a teacher. He gets up at six o'clock every morning. First, he has a shower and gets dressed. Then he eats breakfast with his wife. He usually has bread, cheese and tea. At seven o'clock, he drives to school. The school is not far from his house. His first lesson starts at half past seven. Omar teaches English to children. He loves his job because his students are friendly and they work hard.","qs":[{"q":"Omar gets up at seven o'clock.","k":"tf","o":["True","False"],"a":1},{"q":"Omar goes to school by car.","k":"tf","o":["True","False"],"a":0},{"q":"What does Omar teach?","k":"mcq","o":["Maths","Arabic","English"],"a":2}]}]}